            </div>
            <div class="col-12 mt-2">
              <div class="small text-secondary border rounded bg-body-tertiary p-2">
                <strong>Multi-Provider Fallback Active:</strong> If your selected primary provider (e.g. <code><%= form.aiProvider %></code>) hits rate limits or quota errors, the system automatically attempts any other API keys provided above before falling back to local OCR.
              </div>
